    </patterns>
  </knowledge>

  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0">Declare FULL. 081, 085, 090 ancestors of HEAD; read notes/090-file-store-service.md; check the marker column is live.</step>
    <step order="1">RuleSetService: draft source, marker, compensation and AddDraftsAsync per version; CreateAsync and DTOs retired; NotConverted read.</step>
    <step order="2">Job handler re-keyed; tests (redelivery, lock, compensation, source states).</step>
    <step order="3">The two routes; RuleSetEndpoints routes removed; ledger.</step>
    <step order="4">RateCardImportService file step; tests.</step>
    <step order="5">RuleReview removals; npm install --legacy-peer-deps --no-audit --no-fund, test, build.</step>
    <step order="6">Forms script; removal script; run it read-only on dev and record the verdict.</step>
    <step order="7">Build, test, publish-size delta, /conflict-check; code-review, adr-check, one adversarial pass; uac-r2 review.</step>
    <step order="8">Update TASK-INDEX.md: this task's status cell to "✅ [done]". Notes in projects/ebilling-r1/notes/116-procedure-version-documents.md.</step>
  </steps>

  <escalation>
    <trigger>If sprk_procedureversion.sprk_notconverted does not exist (080 did not add it), STOP and raise 🔔 Human Input Required: the column belongs in 080's P3 before its live run; do not keep the marker on the rule set.</trigger>
    <trigger>If 090's API cannot list a parent's files by purpose or set a row Removed, STOP and report to 090's owner.</trigger>
    <trigger>If the owner wants RuleReview to keep a create or draft action before 084 Part B, STOP and ask.</trigger>
  </escalation>

  <justification>
    <existing>Drafting and import are changed in place; 090's UploadForCallerAsync has no route; CreateRuleSet, the only upload route, is removed.</existing>
    <extension>The routes extend 081's ProcedureEndpoints; the marker goes on the version, not the rule set, because a set spans versions; the script copies 011's.</extension>
    <cost-of-doing-nothing>081's publish needs a Servable source file nothing can write; v2 can never be drafted (the set's marker says drafted); 092 cannot retire the Procedure Library key.</cost-of-doing-nothing>
  </justification>

  <outputs>
    <output type="code">the files in relevant-files</output>
    <output type="test">the test files in relevant-files</output>
    <output type="docs">projects/ebilling-r1/notes/116-procedure-version-documents.md</output>
  </outputs>

  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Drafting a Draft Billing version reads its source file through 090 and stores Proposed, Off rules under that version (publishstate Draft); a redelivery after the marker calls no model; v2 drafts although v1 is drafted.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Negative: no source file, Missing, or two Servable source files → 422 ruleset.source_missing; Pending → transient; Malicious → Poisoned; non-Draft version → 409 procedure_version.not_draft; Ontology Area → 400; a payload without procedureVersionId → Poisoned.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Compensation removes an earlier run's untouched drafts of this version only; a copy-forward draft (policy with a current version) and a draft under another version are kept.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Both routes refuse flagged-external, no systemuser row and a flag-read fault before any read; no Write or no privilege → 403; another Procedure's version → unknown-id 404; file route: non-Draft 409, oversize 413.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">File replace: after a second upload the new row is Servable and the old row Removed; a failed flip leaves the old row Servable.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Rate-card import stores the workbook as the version's source file and returns SourceFileId; a failed file write leaves no card, rate or timekeeper; no SpeFileStore or sprk_document call is made.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">POST /rulesets and /rulesets/{id}/draft are gone; grep sprk_sourcedocument in src/server and tests finds only sprk_storedfile uses; grep ProcedureLibraryContainerId in src/server finds only FinanceOptions, its validator and GraphModule.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">RuleReview builds and its tests pass with no create or draft call and no sourceDocumentId field.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">The removal script's read-only dev run is recorded with its verdict and writes nothing.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">dotnet build exits 0; filtered tests and full ArchTests pass; publish-size delta recorded; no package; no new HIGH CVE.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Cover the stated contract plus the edge cases named above. Anything beyond that needs a one-line justification in task notes.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <ui-tests>
    <test name="RuleReview without create and draft">On dev after 079: the list loads with no "New rule set"; a detail has no "Draft rules"; Accept, Reject, Edit, Publish unchanged; dark mode unchanged.</test>
  </ui-tests>

  <notes>Once merged, 092's Procedure Library escalation clears. 079 deploys this with WP3.</notes>

  <execution>
    <skill>.claude/skills/task-execute/SKILL.md</skill>
